{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_0D726668","title":"Clem offers thanks or not","entry":"Dlg_0D726668::entry","exit":"Dlg_0D726668::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_489D9A6D","articyId":"72057611218073563","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"So, you're back. Did the drop go to plan?","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So, you're back. Did the drop go to plan?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1250.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41595","byteOffset":30064568,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_8D587F35","articyId":"72057611218073569","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"You're back! Thank CORA, I was so worried. You made the drop?","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're back! Thank CORA, I was so worried. You made the drop?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":1250.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48173","byteOffset":32561408,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_A75C6F92","articyId":"72057611218073614","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Yes! I can't wait to see the Corpsters faces when they wake up tomorrow to find their rig covered in blossom! They will hate it!","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes! I can't wait to see the Corpsters faces when they wake up tomorrow to find their rig covered in blossom! They will hate it!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2125.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42032","byteOffset":30228040,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_5486F506","articyId":"72057611218073627","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Please. I know you didn't make it. You were seen, talking to the 'Sec.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Please. I know you didn't make it. You were seen, talking to the 'Sec.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2125.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42601","byteOffset":30444544,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_57EBE94F","articyId":"72057611218073669","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"I don't know what is worse - that I trusted you, or that you think I'll believe your lies.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't know what is worse - that I trusted you, or that you think I'll believe your lies.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3025.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27943","byteOffset":18452128,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_5AE5E0CA","articyId":"72057611218073676","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"You sold us out. At least you're honest about that.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You sold us out. At least you're honest about that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3025.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39248","byteOffset":29180008,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_FF99CFCA","articyId":"72057611218073715","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Whatever. We're done here. Don't think any of us are going to forget this anytime soon.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Whatever. We're done here. Don't think any of us are going to forget this anytime soon.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25257","byteOffset":17438176,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_FD4E339E","articyId":"72057611218073757","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"Thank you, Greenfingers. You are a true friend. And we look after our friends. That means special prices for life. It's the least we can do.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thank you, Greenfingers. You are a true friend. And we look after our friends. That means special prices for life. It's the least we can do.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3025.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24423","byteOffset":17117296,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_3B279907","articyId":"72057611218073772","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Clem Hortelano","text":"De nada. Thaddeus would be proud.","speakerId":"Ntt_B4B449F3","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"De nada. Thaddeus would be proud.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3649.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37518","byteOffset":28531336,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_609AE69F","articyId":"72057611218073589","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"One package delivered safe and sound.","speakerId"